        "pitch": "Imagine San Francisco... but run entirely by cats. They\u2019re the baristas, the tech CEOs, the street artists - everything. And then, a relentlessly cheerful corgi named Pip arrives, tail wagging, determined to find work. 'Golden Gate Hustle' is a whimsical, live-action short film about Pip\u2019s hilarious and heartwarming struggle against the city's feline monopoly. We\u2019ll see him trying \u2013 and spectacularly failing \u2013 at everything from cable car operation to dog-walking for cats (yes, you read that right). The visuals will lean into the iconic San Francisco landscapes with a deliberately quirky, slightly surreal feel \u2013 think Wes Anderson meets a San Francisco postcard. The soundtrack will be upbeat and jazzy, punctuated by the subtle sound of purring and occasional, exasperated cat sighs. Ultimately, 'Golden Gate Hustle' is a story about perseverance, finding your place, and maybe, just maybe, winning the hearts (and jobs) of even the most discerning feline employers.",
